# On the GPU after steps 2-6:
# 1. Step 1, one network for both tenures (a tenure indicator) on the same
#    model: the settings of the step-1 CPU set (8,192 households, 3,000 steps,
#    learning rate 1e-3), so it compares with step1cpu_ret; the choices must
#    not depend on the indicator.
# 2. Step 1 trained longer and wider: 128 units, 16,384 households, learning
#    rate 3e-3, 6,000 steps.
# Run: JULIA_CUDA_SOFT_MEMORY_LIMIT=3GiB JULIA_CUDA_HARD_MEMORY_LIMIT=6GiB JULIA_FLAGS=--heap-size-hint=3G bash neural/scripts/queue.sh neural/jobs/step1_long_gpu.jobs 1
step1gpu_joint testset_1_nohousing_fine.mat variants=ret_n8192_joint
step1gpu_ret_w128_lr3_k6000 testset_1_nohousing_fine.mat variants=ret_w128_lr3e-3_k6000
